BS_:

BU_: BMW_I3

CM_ "Draft DBC derived from BMW i3 FlexRay and PT-CAN logs. Address 27 was not observed in any uploaded segment. Signals below intentionally mix three classes: confirmed parse signals already used by CarState, state/proxy helpers useful for reverse engineering, and unresolved TX candidates kept for shadow-debug correlation.";

BO_ 46 WHEEL_SPEED: 17 BMW_I3
 SG_ WHEEL_SPEED_RAW_WORD_A : 8|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ WHEEL_SPEED_RAW_WORD_B : 24|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ WHEEL_SPEED_RAW_WORD_C : 40|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ WHEEL_SPEED_RAW_WORD_D : 56|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ RL_SPEED_RAW : 24|16@1+ (0.015625,-511.984375) [0|65535] "kph" BMW_I3
 SG_ RR_SPEED_RAW : 40|16@1+ (0.015625,-511.984375) [0|65535] "kph" BMW_I3
 SG_ FL_SPEED_RAW : 56|16@1+ (0.015625,-511.984375) [0|65535] "kph" BMW_I3
 SG_ FR_SPEED_RAW : 72|16@1+ (0.015625,-511.984375) [0|65535] "kph" BMW_I3
 CM_ BO_ 46 "Confirmed BMW-style wheel-speed helper aligned with the SP2018 bit layout. Wheel speeds remain the secondary/fallback vehicle-speed source in current CarState.";

BO_ 49 STEER_TORQUE: 17 BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_CYCLE_RAW : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_A : 8|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_B : 24|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_C : 40|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_RAW_WORD_D : 56|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ DRIVER_STEER_TORQUE_BMW : 24|12@1+ (0.005,-10) [-10|10.475] "Nm" BMW_I3
 SG_ STEER_TORQUE_STATUS_RAW : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 CM_ BO_ 49 "Confirmed steering-torque helper. BMW-style driver torque lives in the 24|12 field and is valid on the cycle-0 subframe. CarState uses this path for steeringTorque/steeringPressed.";

